i-language:EN-GB\">Contents of Program&nbsp;</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\nCalibri;color:black\"><u1:p>&nbsp;</u1:p></span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\nCalibri;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\npadding:0cm;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB\">This program consists of 13-hour Japanese\nLanguage Courses including lessons given by lecturers and individual tutorial\nsessions,&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\n&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;;color:black;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\npadding:0cm;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB\">12-hour self-study using e-learning\nsystem, 3-hour English lectures on Japanese Culture and Society, plus\nopportunity to interact with local Japanese TMU students for language and\ncultural exchange. Please refer to the 2nd&nbsp;page of the flyer for the\ntimetable.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\n&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black\"><u1:p>&nbsp;</u1:p><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Yu Mincho&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\nCalibri;color:black\"><u1:p><br style=\"mso-